1
00:00:00,620 --> 00:00:04,520
(Sheldon:)Where am I going to find
uranium-235 this time of night?

2
00:00:07,530 --> 00:00:09,730
(Sheldon:)Come on, CraigsList.

3
00:00:13,870 --> 00:00:16,900
(Leonard:)Is it racist that I took you
to an Indian restaurant?

4
00:00:16,900 --> 00:00:20,370
(Priya:)It's okay, I like Indian food.

5
00:00:20,370 --> 00:00:23,840
(Leonard:)Or as you probably call it
back home, "food." (chuckles)

6
00:00:23,840 --> 00:00:26,780
(Priya:)Why didn't you wear
your contacts?

7
00:00:26,780 --> 00:00:28,080
(Priya:)Don't you like them?

8
00:00:28,080 --> 00:00:29,350
(Leonard:)No, no, I do.

9
00:00:29,350 --> 00:00:31,420
(Leonard:)It's just I knew I was having
curry tonight

10
00:00:31,420 --> 00:00:34,950
(Leonard:)and I only want one part
of my body to burn at a time.

11
00:00:36,790 --> 00:00:38,930
You know... (clears throat)

12
00:00:38,930 --> 00:00:41,830
(Priya:)...my company offered me a
position here in Los Angeles.

13
00:00:41,830 --> 00:00:45,930
(Leonard:)Does that mean you'd relocate
here permanently?

14
00:00:45,930 --> 00:00:48,470
(Priya:)Maybe. What do you think?

15
00:00:48,470 --> 00:00:50,800
(Leonard:)I love it.

16
00:00:50,800 --> 00:00:52,770
(Leonard:)That's great!
(knocking)

17
00:00:52,770 --> 00:00:55,910
(Penny(knocking on window):)Hi!

18
00:00:56,610 --> 00:00:59,410
(Penny(knocking on window):)Hi! Just hang on.

